msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi-san said something to me\r\n"
"just before he died.\r\n"
"He said someone in the Tojo Clan was\r\n"
"trying to take control of the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"I think so, too.\r\n"
"These four are the only ones in the Tojo\r\n"
"Clan who could pull this off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid ""
"Kashiwagi-san said one more thing to me.\r\n"
"He said that the traitor was working\r\n"
"with the man who shot Daigo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "The man who shot Daigo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"This is the man who shot Daigo and Nakahara⑬the man\r\n"
"who owns the land targeted by the resort deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "What the!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "That's Shintaro Kazama! Your foster father!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "I'm not so sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"So we have this Kazama-san look alike who shot Daigo and Nakahara.\r\n"
"Those foreigners in black suits."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"And the helicopter attack.\r\n"
"Just what are we up against?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"Well for the moment, our only option is\r\n"
"to look for the traitor in the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
" I'll see if I can find out anything about\r\n"
"the man in the picture.\r\n"
"You go after Kanda. It seems likely\r\n"
"that he was behind Kashiwagi's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"From what I hear, Kanda has his men bring a\r\n"
"woman to his hotel room every night.\r\n"
"They should know where he is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"This porn star wannabe is Goh Hamazaki,\r\n"
"Patriarch of the Hamazaki Family.\r\n"
"Also known as the \"Emperor of Yokohama\"."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Yokohama, eh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Yeah.\r\n"
"He took over Yokohama three years ago after the\r\n"
"Snake Flower Triad was pushed out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"This one's a tough nut to crack.\r\n"
"For some reason, he remains friendly with the\r\n"
"Chinese gang whose territory he took."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "The Snake Flower Triad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Yeah.\r\n"
"Yes. But that's not the only mystery about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "His organization only has around ten members."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"You'd normally need at least 500, no, make that\r\n"
"1,000 men to fight the Snake Flower Triad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"But he was able to just waltz into town and take\r\n"
"over without lifting a finger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "How is that possible?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"He's probably got ties with the Chinese mafia,\r\n"
"probably helping them smuggle and\r\n"
"laundering their money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "Of course, they may just be using him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Chinese mafia connections, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"I don't have proof, but if the resort deal's\r\n"
"connected, he may be behind all of this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"So you're saying he may be working with the Chinese\r\n"
"to get a piece of that Okinawa resort."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"They may even have something like illegal\r\n"
"gambling in mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"This is Yoshitaka Mine, chairman of the Hakuho\r\n"
"Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Yoshitaka Mine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid ""
"He's young and rich. Spends most of his time in\r\n"
"office buildings downtown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"He drives expensive foreign cars and looks like\r\n"
"a young businessman."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"He made a fortune in insider trading,\r\n"
"as well as real estate.\r\n"
"Sort of a white-collar yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "I get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid ""
"He's currently the main source of the Tojo\r\n"
"Clan's money⑬this guy wipes his ass with cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Kanda of the Nishikiyama Family in particular has\r\n"
"been receiving plenty of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "How did this guy end up with Kanda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Until a few years ago, Mine was just a normal\r\n"
"venture capitalist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"It seems that Kanda was the one who convinced\r\n"
"him to join the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"With Kanda's introduction, Mine established\r\n"
"ties with Daigo and joined the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "So Mine may be working with Kanda then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid ""
"No, Mine's loyal to the sixth chairman.\r\n"
"His own organization has gotten a lot stronger recently,\r\n"
"and he no longer needs Kanda's support."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "I think he's trying to distance himself from Kanda at this point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"This cue ball is Tsuyoshi Kanda, Third Patriarch\r\n"
"of the Nishikiyama Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "The Nishikiyama Family, eh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid "The same organization that you fought three years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "I've never met him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"I'm not surprised.\r\n"
"He was in prison for two years on a\r\n"
"sexual assault charge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"He's the typical fighting and women loving type.\r\n"
"He probably wouldn't have been more than a foot\r\n"
"soldier when Nishikiyama was around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "So how did he get to be patriarch?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"As soon as he got out of prison, he began\r\n"
"expanding his territory using brute force."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "It was just after the conflict between the Tojo Clan and the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"He came on the scene just as the police were\r\n"
"backing off the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid ""
"He was able to quickly take over the Kazama\r\n"
"Family's territory."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "What does he want?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid ""
"Probably to be Tojo Clan chairman.\r\n"
"What he doesn't have, he takes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid ""
"Whether it's women or territory, he'll stop at\r\n"
"nothing to get what he wants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Could he have shot Kashiwagi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "There's a good chance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "All right, who do you wanna talk about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Who do you wanna talk about next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Do you have any other questions?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
